      ]
    },
    {
      "block_label": "text",
      "block_content": "54. How is the advice given likely to react to the rejection of their advice?\nA) They may regard it as a threat. C) They get ready for a larger conflict.\nB) They may modify their behavior. D) They begin to doubt their self-worth.",
      "block_bbox": [
        68,
        951,
        919,
