    },
    {
      "block_label": "text",
      "block_content": "55. What should the advice receiver do to avoid unnecessary conflict?\nA) Concede the advice is perfectly reasonable.\nB) Give their reasons for not taking the advice.\nC) Understand why the advice giver offers the advice.\nD) Explain their chosen way of handling the situation",
